---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Cannabicum | Magyar Orvosi Kannabisz Konferencia"
  description="A Cannabicum a magyar orvosi kannabisz szakmai párbeszédének fóruma. Értesítünk, amikor megnyílik a weboldal."
>
  <main>
    <nav class="nav shell" aria-label="Fő navigáció">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Cannabicum kezdőlap">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Cannabicum</span>
      </a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#kapcsolat">Kapcsolat <span>↘</span></a>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero shell">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Magyar Orvosi Kannabisz Konferencia</p>
        <h1>A tudás<br /><em>összeköt.</em></h1>
        <p class="intro">
          Egy hely, ahol az orvostudomány, a kutatás és a valódi tapasztalatok találkoznak.
          A Cannabicum hamarosan megnyitja kapuit.
        </p>
        <a class="primary-button" href="#kapcsolat">Értesítést kérek <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Cannabicum logó">
        <div class="orbit orbit-outer"></div>
        <div class="orbit orbit-inner"></div>
        <div class="visual-word">cannabicum</div>
        <p class="visual-caption">TUDOMÁNY<br /><span>×</span> EMBER<br /><strong>×</strong> JÖVŐ</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="notice">
      <div class="shell notice-inner">
        <span class="notice-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Hamarosan</p>
          <h2>Értesítünk, ha megnyílik a weboldal.</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="#kapcsolat" class="notice-link">Feliratkozom <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about shell">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Miért a Cannabicum?</p>
        <h2>Nyitott párbeszéd<br /><em>jobb döntésekért.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>
          Független, szakmai közösséget építünk az orvosi kannabisz hazai jövőjéért.
          Hiteles információt, érthető tudást és egymásra figyelő beszélgetéseket hozunk közelebb.
        </p>
        <div class="principles">
          <span><b>01</b> Tudomány</span>
          <span><b>02</b> Párbeszéd</span>
          <span><b>03</b> Együttműködés</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="kapcsolat">
      <div class="shell contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Maradj kapcsolatban</p>
          <h2>Legyél<br /><em>az elsők között.</em></h2>
          <p>Add meg az elérhetőséged, és szólunk, amint új hírekkel jelentkezünk.</p>
        </div>
        <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="contact-form">
          <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="307a6957-6a89-4638-bf46-83e4d7251711" />
          <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Új Cannabicum érdeklődő" />
          <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Cannabicum weboldal" />
          <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="hidden" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
          <label for="name">Név</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Hogy szólíthatunk?" required />
          <label for="email">E-mail-cím</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="te@email.hu" required />
          <label for="message">Üzenet <span>(opcionális)</span></label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Írj nekünk pár sort…"></textarea>
          <button type="submit">Értesítést kérek <span>↗</span></button>
          <small>Az adataidat kizárólag a kapcsolatfelvételhez használjuk.</small>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer shell">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Cannabicum kezdőlap"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Cannabicum</span></a>
      <p>Magyar Orvosi Kannabisz Konferencia</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@cannabicum.hu">hello@cannabicum.hu</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  @import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap");
  :global(:root) { font-family: "Manrope", sans-serif; color: #151515; background: #f7f8f2; }
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #f7f8f2; }
  .shell { width: min(1240px, 100%); margin: auto; padding-left: 5vw; padding-right: 5vw; }
  .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 28px; }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: #151515; text-decoration: none; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .brand-mark { width: 25px; height: 25px; display: inline-block; border-radius: 50%; background: repeating-conic-gradient(#62bd18 0 9deg, transparent 9deg 17deg); mask: radial-gradient(circle, transparent 0 37%, #000 39%); }
  .nav-cta { color: #151515; text-decoration: none; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .nav-cta span, .primary-button span, .notice-link span, button span { color: #61bb18; font-size: 1.2rem; margin-left: 20px; }
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap: 5vw; align-items: center; min-height: 620px; padding-top: 70px; padding-bottom: 95px; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 22px; color: #5a9e1b; font: 500 .65rem/1.4 "DM Mono", monospace; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1, h2 { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.08em; line-height: .92; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8.5rem); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5.5vw, 5.6rem); }
  h1 em, h2 em { color: #62b916; font-style: normal; }
  .intro { max-width: 390px; margin: 30px 0 0; color: #60665d; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .primary-button, button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; border: 0; background: #151515; color: #f7f8f2; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; font: 700 .75rem "Manrope", sans-serif; padding: 17px 20px; margin-top: 34px; }
  .hero-visual { position: relative; min-height: 470px; overflow: hidden; background: #d9efb8; }
  .orbit { position: absolute; border: 18px dashed #62bd18; border-radius: 50%; transform: rotate(-18deg); }
  .orbit-outer { width: 520px; height: 520px; top: -25px; left: -35px; }
  .orbit-inner { width: 390px; height: 390px; top: 40px; left: 30px; border-width: 12px; border-color: #9bd220; }
  .visual-word { position: absolute; left: 11%; top: 43%; color: #151515; font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5.2vw, 5.4rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.1em; }
  .visual-caption { position: absolute; right: 25px; bottom: 24px; color: #37630f; font: .62rem/1.6 "DM Mono", monospace; letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .visual-caption span { color: #f48b31; }.visual-caption strong { color: #151515; }
  .notice { background: #173d29; color: #f7f8f2; }
  .notice-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding-top: 26px; padding-bottom: 26px; }
  .notice .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 5px; color: #a8dc28; }.notice h2 { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 2.4rem); letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .notice-dot { width: 13px; height: 13px; flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 50%; background: #a8dc28; box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(168,220,40,.12); }
  .notice-link { margin-left: auto; color: #f7f8f2; text-decoration: none; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8vw; padding-top: 130px; padding-bottom: 130px; }
  .about-copy { align-self: end; color: #60665d; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 420px; }.about-copy p { margin: 0; }
  .principles { display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 45px; color: #151515; font: .65rem "DM Mono", monospace; }
  .principles span { border-top: 1px solid #cfd5c8; padding-top: 12px; }.principles b { margin-right: 8px; color: #62b916; font-weight: 400; }
  .contact { background: #c7e781; }.contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; gap: 9vw; padding-top: 110px; padding-bottom: 110px; }
  .contact-copy p:last-child { max-width: 300px; margin-top: 30px; color: #395226; line-height: 1.6; }.contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  label { margin-top: 18px; color: #35501e; font: 500 .64rem "DM Mono", monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; } label:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; } label span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; opacity: .7; }
  input, textarea { width: 100%; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(21,21,21,.35); border-radius: 0; background: transparent; padding: 11px 0; color: #151515; font: 1rem "Manrope", sans-serif; outline: none; } input:focus, textarea:focus { border-color: #151515; } textarea { resize: vertical; }
  input::placeholder, textarea::placeholder { color: #5d7146; }.hidden { display: none; }
  button { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 28px; }.contact-form small { margin-top: 16px; color: #4e653b; font-size: .65rem; }
  .footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding-top: 27px; padding-bottom: 30px; font-size: .68rem; }.footer p { color: #72786f; }.footer > a:last-child { color: #31571d; text-decoration: none; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .hero, .about, .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.hero { padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 60px; }.hero-visual { min-height: 350px; margin-top: 15px; }.orbit-outer { width: 390px; height: 390px; }.orbit-inner { width: 290px; height: 290px; }.visual-word { top: 43%; }
    .notice-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }.notice-link { margin-left: 37px; }.about { gap: 50px; padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 80px; }.contact-grid { gap: 55px; padding-top: 75px; padding-bottom: 75px; }.footer { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  }
</style>
